# ============================================
# Embedding Service Configuration
# ============================================

# Google Gemini API Key
# Required only if using Gemini embedding model
# Can also be configured via Admin Panel: Settings > API Configuration
# Get your API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# ============================================
# Usage Instructions
# ============================================
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. Replace your_gemini_api_key_here with your actual API key
# 3. OR configure via Admin Panel after starting the service
#
# Model Switching:
# - Switch between MiniLM (local) and Gemini (cloud) via Admin Panel
# - MiniLM: Free, offline, 384 dimensions
# - Gemini: Requires API key, 768 dimensions, rate limits apply
